        "description": "Self-contained local subset of the SNOMED CT, LOINC and CPT codes that Thaakat's cluster engine is allowed to emit. Each concept mirrors exactly one real code (recorded on the base-system / base-code properties) so the code can be validated server-side via CodeSystem/$validate-code instead of being trusted blindly. This retires the hallucinated-code risk: the AI selects a key, the server confirms the code is real. Decision-support / navigation only, never diagnosis; every concept is flagged verify=true for human confirmation before real clinical use. Production swaps this ~12-code subset for full UMLS-linked SNOMED/LOINC/CPT terminology while keeping the same $validate-code contract.",
